--- !u!114 &3005344366426323207
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2698862438721937757}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 64d20703c688ca34f93bfa0d8382353f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  message:
  - actorId: 0
    message: "A new recruit, I\xB4ve never seen you here before. I\xB4m guessing
      you\xB4re here for the trials and take the captain\xB4s seat."
  - actorId: 1
    message: "That\xB4s right!"
  - actorId: 0
    message: Everybody thinks they have what it takes, little do they know...
  - actorId: 0
    message: "I won\xB4t stop you, the less competition the better, I should be running
      this crew anyway."
  - actorId: 1
    message: So, what are the trials?
  - actorId: 0
    message: "Very well.  I\xB4ll only said this once so listen close"
  - actorId: 0
    message: For the first trial, you will be paddeling your way to the desertic
      islands, The Dunes. There you must find the lost dagger which belonged to the
      last king of the long gone civilization of those sands.
  - actorId: 0
    message: "As a second trial, you will be travelling to the dangerous tropical
      islands, we are looking for a new place to expand our territory, our crew is
      getting crowded, unfortunatly, we\xB4lll need a place to settle new people.
      To take the island you will need to kill it\xB4s main protector, hidden somwhere
      in the islands."
  - actorId: 0
    message: "The third trial takes place in the Frost Lands. These frozen rocks
      are the only place where our captain ever tasted defeat against the beast that
      lives among those ice lakes. To pass this trial you will need to find the captain\xB4s
      sword and get revenge, killing the beast which lives there"
  - actorId: 0
    message: Finally, the fourth and final trial. You must go to the steaming shores
      of the Vulcanic Wastelands.
  - actorId: 0
    message: "There you must find the captain\xB4s crown which is being protected
      by the monster whiich resides in those waters and bring it back to us."
  - actorId: 0
    message: So, ready?
  - actorId: 1
    message: "Let\xB4s do it!"
  actors:
  - name: Kali
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e6b27bf420882054e890dcc5e2d2473d, type: 3}
  - name: You
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2c6059bece9b90b48bcd741bbeac4168, type: 3}
